"fixitgirl" <girodj@gmail.com> wrote:

> And on a side note:  how do you "unstack" items?  I really didn't want
> to drop all 12 tripe rations at once.

Every time in your post you said 'drop' and you needed to say 'throw'. You 
need to throw food to a non-tame dog or cat to get it to eat it. Dropping 
it on the floor won't have the desired effect. 

To *throw* just one out of a stack just give the command a count. So if 
your tripe rations are inventory letter 'r' just type 't1r' and a direction 
to throw 1 ration.


